    description: Some("A kangaroo and a squirrel race across a grid of trampolines that scrolls downward, each claiming pink ones by landing on them and scoring again when a claimed trampoline drops off the bottom. Land on a white Magic Mat to glow, then touch your rival to freeze him; a Tricky Trap makes the trampoline you just left vanish for good."),
